{
  "slug": "autoresearch",
  "name": "Autoresearch",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous experiment loops on any codebase — one file, one metric, one loop. An agent edits a constrained file, runs an eval, keeps improvements, reverts failures, and repeats unattended. Based on Karpathy’s autoresearch pattern, generalized beyond ML training to any code with a measurable outcome.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `autoresearch` (Set up and run Karpathy-style autoresearch experiments on any codebase with a measurable metric), `autoresearch-discover` (Scan a codebase to find files and functions where autoresearch could be applied — code with tunable parameters,…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install autoresearch@claude-community` from `pjhoberman/autoresearch`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
